{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10003_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:691d1dc0fe4d2c42ec6e91e24121a70c6d5bdd32dc47969ecd2151e578a9f389",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:076e81c5f9e1bc555babfd8d315221cee4991b5d11914c38b5454bc81cdbeb3d",
      "text": "Cafe Parade店内",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54351d52e17d4bf35b3051cb64569213017056a61079ce5f46004b05e06f2937",
      "text": "各位，饮品都已经倒好了呢。\n那么神谷，拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f19366df01b78f47148b13503c32205d568b61b9ef807b7818496d5b3107b245",
      "text": "啊啊。今年也发生了很多事呢。\n能像这样和大家一起度过年末，我很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4a4a481261acee2fe4d8332ba2dd032e0d9bc2d2b4b238af920a53e8e3d80cd",
      "text": "珠宝的CM也顺利播出了，\n今天就痛痛快快地庆祝一番吧。干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24",
      "text": "干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:678d5bcc12c76733f7e51260f0f068403fd239155952cdb38fb1491e9f6694d5",
      "text": "呐呐，看社交平台了吗？\n我们的CM反响超级好的哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45626e7c46c38402d3d8fc7e000ded8840d8a5bcbed615110209f2db870fd0e4",
      "text": "也有人晒出了珠宝的照片呢。\n还有人写了“非常喜欢”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ea544768e1a70048a98a6128f2b30c11297d283f9c5975d18cb1543cfce1a03",
      "text": "听说还有人是因为阿斯兰先生的台词，\n才下定决心购买的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbc00a4baa991e3a09a7148d4f1be6a24dd670d115ad7e3086410ab7afa4b338",
      "text": "此、此话当真？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4333cc8c62ee2b6efddd9a792b2a735470f31c861c7ef8b4c2704c43a6f2e8c6",
      "text": "阿斯兰的……大家的心意，\n都切实地传达给每个人了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75de1c29d5d9ed5e0f8dae07d43a3cce339d05c6ce8758dff52840b06de4169d",
      "text": "明年开始也为了给更多的人带去幸福，\n一起加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
